From 0872eaa95330d9af83b01ae9a5db8153c64d1b1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 20:52:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Extend Quant2 parity to gfx90a and gfx1100

- Add full gfx1100 CK feature orchestration.
- Keep complete gfx1100 Triton fallback coverage.
- Add correctness-complete gfx90a Triton routing.
- Retain gfx90a CK2 for measured core problems.
- Route large and advanced gfx90a cases to Triton.
- Add architecture-specific forced backend controls.
- Pass 41 gfx1100 tests and 32 gfx90a tests.
- Defer gfx90a scatter dependency validation.
- Measure CK faster for small and tiny shapes.
- Measure Triton faster for `4096x14336` shapes.

Tools used:
- GPT-5.6 Sol: coding agent

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
